    <div>
      <p begin="00:00:46.460" end="00:00:51.500" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00:46.460" end="00:00:47.570">Still</span><span begin="00:00:47.570" end="00:00:47.570">, </span><span begin="00:00:47.570" end="00:00:47.660">I </span><span begin="00:00:47.660" end="00:00:48.140">seek </span><span begin="00:00:48.140" end="00:00:48.440">a </span><span begin="00:00:48.440" end="00:00:48.890">loving </span><span begin="00:00:48.890" end="00:00:49.220">for </span><span begin="00:00:49.220" end="00:00:49.340">my </span><span begin="00:00:49.340" end="00:00:50.030">load </span><span begin="00:00:50.030" end="00:00:50.240">I</span><span begin="00:00:50.240" end="00:00:50.270">’</span><span begin="00:00:50.270" end="00:00:50.300">ll </span><span begin="00:00:50.300" end="00:00:50.540">come </span><span begin="00:00:50.540" end="00:00:50.570">a </span><span begin="00:00:50.570" end="00:00:51.500">howler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我仍然在寻找爱情来分担我的重担</span></p>
      <p begin="00:00:51.830" end="00:00:56.180" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:00:51.830" end="00:00:52.100">you </span><span begin="00:00:52.100" end="00:00:52.850">always </span><span begin="00:00:52.850" end="00:00:53.150">like </span><span begin="00:00:53.150" end="00:00:53.390">to </span><span begin="00:00:53.390" end="00:00:54.050">listen </span><span begin="00:00:54.050" end="00:00:54.440">my </span><span begin="00:00:54.440" end="00:00:56.180">question</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你总是喜欢聆听问题</span></p>
      <p begin="00:00:56.450" end="00:01:01.100" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:00:56.450" end="00:00:57.260">Still</span><span begin="00:00:57.260" end="00:00:57.530">, </span><span begin="00:00:57.530" end="00:00:57.620">I </span><span begin="00:00:57.620" end="00:00:58.430">like </span><span begin="00:00:58.430" end="00:00:58.850">navy </span><span begin="00:00:58.850" end="00:00:59.240">blue </span><span begin="00:00:59.240" end="00:00:59.990">sky </span><span begin="00:00:59.990" end="00:01:00.650">in </span><span begin="00:01:00.650" end="00:01:00.860">that </span><span begin="00:01:00.860" end="00:01:01.100">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我仍然喜欢那晚深蓝的夜空</span></p>
      <p begin="00:01:01.310" end="00:01:06.230" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:01:01.310" end="00:01:01.610">And </span><span begin="00:01:01.610" end="00:01:01.880">this </span><span begin="00:01:01.880" end="00:01:02.030">is </span><span begin="00:01:02.030" end="00:01:02.570">like </span><span begin="00:01:02.570" end="00:01:02.720">You</span><span begin="00:01:02.720" end="00:01:02.750">’</span><span begin="00:01:02.750" end="00:01:02.870">re </span><span begin="00:01:02.870" end="00:01:03.380">always </span><span begin="00:01:03.380" end="00:01:04.160">seeking </span><span begin="00:01:04.160" end="00:01:04.610">an </span><span begin="00:01:04.610" end="00:01:05.570">answer </span><span begin="00:01:05.570" end="00:01:05.930">I </span><span begin="00:01:05.930" end="00:01:06.230">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这正如你一直在寻找一个我知道的答案</span></p>
      <p begin="00:01:06.290" end="00:01:11.120" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:01:06.290" end="00:01:06.500">I </span><span begin="00:01:06.500" end="00:01:06.860">feel </span><span begin="00:01:06.860" end="00:01:07.250">life </span><span begin="00:01:07.250" end="00:01:07.430">I </span><span begin="00:01:07.430" end="00:01:08.090">fashing </span><span begin="00:01:08.090" end="00:01:08.450">too </span><span begin="00:01:08.450" end="00:01:08.810">dark </span><span begin="00:01:08.810" end="00:01:08.990">and </span><span begin="00:01:08.990" end="00:01:09.470">small </span><span begin="00:01:09.470" end="00:01:10.010">since </span><span begin="00:01:10.010" end="00:01:10.610">around </span><span begin="00:01:10.610" end="00:01:11.120">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">自从在你身边，我感觉生活变得黑暗而渺小</span></p>
      <p begin="00:01:11.120" end="00:01:15.950" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:01:11.120" end="00:01:11.570">Fine</span><span begin="00:01:11.570" end="00:01:11.810">, </span><span begin="00:01:11.810" end="00:01:12.470">you </span><span begin="00:01:12.470" end="00:01:13.160">need </span><span begin="00:01:13.160" end="00:01:13.700">a </span><span begin="00:01:13.700" end="00:01:14.930">living </span><span begin="00:01:14.930" end="00:01:15.950">flower</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">好吧，你需要的是一朵鲜活的花儿</span></p>
      <p begin="00:01:16.250" end="00:01:20.900" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:01:16.250" end="00:01:16.430">I </span><span begin="00:01:16.430" end="00:01:16.790">feel </span><span begin="00:01:16.790" end="00:01:17.150">like </span><span begin="00:01:17.150" end="00:01:17.360">I </span><span begin="00:01:17.360" end="00:01:17.690">face </span><span begin="00:01:17.690" end="00:01:18.110">such </span><span begin="00:01:18.110" end="00:01:18.260">a </span><span begin="00:01:18.260" end="00:01:18.650">sweet </span><span begin="00:01:18.650" end="00:01:18.920">night </span><span begin="00:01:18.920" end="00:01:19.460">since </span><span begin="00:01:19.460" end="00:01:20.480">belong </span><span begin="00:01:20.480" end="00:01:20.750">to </span><span begin="00:01:20.750" end="00:01:20.900">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">自从属于你，我感觉面对的是这样甜蜜的夜晚</span></p>
      <p begin="00:01:20.930" end="00:01:26.450" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:01:20.930" end="00:01:21.590">Fine</span><span begin="00:01:21.590" end="00:01:21.800">, </span><span begin="00:01:21.800" end="00:01:22.340">you </span><span begin="00:01:22.340" end="00:01:23.150">seek </span><span begin="00:01:23.150" end="00:01:23.690">a </span><span begin="00:01:23.690" end="00:01:24.950">quiet </span><span begin="00:01:24.950" end="00:01:26.450">morning</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">好吧，你寻找的是一个宁静的清晨</span></p>
