      <p begin="00:03:06.260" end="00:03:11.330" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="00:03:06.260" end="00:03:06.350">“</span><span begin="00:03:06.350" end="00:03:06.440">Not </span><span begin="00:03:06.440" end="00:03:06.980">here</span><span begin="00:03:06.980" end="00:03:07.520">”</span><span begin="00:03:07.520" end="00:03:07.520">, </span><span begin="00:03:07.520" end="00:03:08.000">so </span><span begin="00:03:08.000" end="00:03:08.300">far </span><span begin="00:03:08.300" end="00:03:08.480">you </span><span begin="00:03:08.480" end="00:03:09.830">say </span><span begin="00:03:09.830" end="00:03:10.070">in </span><span begin="00:03:10.070" end="00:03:11.330">sadness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">“无心于此”，你至今这么说着，满怀忧伤</span></p>
      <p begin="00:03:11.630" end="00:03:13.340" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="00:03:11.630" end="00:03:12.620">Whenever </span><span begin="00:03:12.620" end="00:03:12.830">you </span><span begin="00:03:12.830" end="00:03:13.340">doze</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">无论你何时小寐</span></p>
      <p begin="00:03:13.520" end="00:03:16.310" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="00:03:13.520" end="00:03:13.700">I </span><span begin="00:03:13.700" end="00:03:14.240">should </span><span begin="00:03:14.240" end="00:03:14.660">keep </span><span begin="00:03:14.660" end="00:03:16.310">silence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我都应保持安静</span></p>
      <p begin="00:03:16.670" end="00:03:21.320" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="00:03:16.670" end="00:03:16.700">“</span><span begin="00:03:16.700" end="00:03:17.090">Not </span><span begin="00:03:17.090" end="00:03:17.450">here</span><span begin="00:03:17.450" end="00:03:17.480">”</span><span begin="00:03:17.480" end="00:03:17.570">, </span><span begin="00:03:17.570" end="00:03:17.930">so </span><span begin="00:03:17.930" end="00:03:18.260">far </span><span begin="00:03:18.260" end="00:03:18.500">you </span><span begin="00:03:18.500" end="00:03:19.820">say </span><span begin="00:03:19.820" end="00:03:20.090">in </span><span begin="00:03:20.090" end="00:03:21.320">grayness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">“无心于此”，你至今这么说着，满目灰白</span></p>
      <p begin="00:03:21.350" end="00:03:29.360" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="00:03:21.350" end="00:03:21.920">How </span><span begin="00:03:21.920" end="00:03:22.460">come </span><span begin="00:03:22.460" end="00:03:22.940">how </span><span begin="00:03:22.940" end="00:03:23.510">love </span><span begin="00:03:23.510" end="00:03:23.930">we </span><span begin="00:03:23.930" end="00:03:24.200">are </span><span begin="00:03:24.200" end="00:03:24.740">so </span><span begin="00:03:24.740" end="00:03:25.370">far </span><span begin="00:03:25.370" end="00:03:26.030">from </span><span begin="00:03:26.030" end="00:03:29.360">then</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">为何我们的爱是如此的遥远</span></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>